# MIT License — auxiliary project material

This license covers **everything in the repository EXCEPT the book** —
that is, all auxiliary material: the fact-check records (`factcheck/`),
the review and planning artifacts (`reviews/`, `archive/`, and the audit
files under `docs/`), the runnable examples (`examples/`, which also
carries a local copy of this grant in `examples/LICENSE`), the build and
verification tooling (`scripts/`, `tools/`, `Makefile` and its build
configuration), the figure generators (`figures-src/`), the renderer-bug
knowledge base (`docs/github-markdown-math-bugs.md`, `docs/render-tests/`,
`docs/upstream-feedback/`), the process and style methodology
(`PROCESS.md`, `STYLE.md`), the project-status and planning documents
