You are welcome to adapt any of it for your own books and projects.

The **book** is NOT covered here; it is dual-licensed per the root
`LICENSE` file, and comprises only the publishable manuscript under
`book/` together with its own table of contents and charter (`TOC.md`,
`BookDescription.md`).

